This directory is for assistnat-generated docs. Separate from human docs; not authoritative vs root docs.

## Layout

- assistant status, RCA, bug/todo stack, align logs, implementation notes.
- non-authoritative unit-design supplements (close practical unit-phase gaps).

## Index

- `issue-stack.md` — live open/done bug and todo stack
- `unit-design/` — non-authoritative unit design pack (decisions, coverage matrix, supplements, new units)
